1
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:09,610
Yamao.

2
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:11,370
Do you even know what you're doing?

3
00:00:12,280 --> 00:00:12,820
When the time comes,

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:14,480
how will you explain yourself

5
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:15,320
to your master, Danshen?

6
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,210
Of course I know

7
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:17,070
what I'm doing.

8
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,420
You're the one

9
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:19,810
who refuses to see reason!

10
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:22,490
How dare you!

11
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:23,890
If Danshen knew

12
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:25,140
Qi Fengyin had led you astray

13
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:26,250
and made you the devil's lackey,

14
00:00:26,670 --> 00:00:27,740
he'd be devastated.

15
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,110
For Danshen's sake,

16
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,330
and for everyone in this world,

17
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,940
you and Qi Fengyin must die today!

18
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:30,940
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

19
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:38,940
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

20
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:44,220
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

21
00:01:47,900 --> 00:01:55,460
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

22
00:01:55,820 --> 00:02:02,580
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

23
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:10,460
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

24
00:02:11,660 --> 00:02:18,500
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

25
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:26,620
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

26
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,180
[Blossom in Darkness]

27
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:35,180
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

28
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:38,180
[Episode 14]

29
00:02:43,590 --> 00:02:44,220
Du Zhong.

30
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,380
You wanted to become immortal,

31
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,890
so you murdered countless people

32
00:02:49,470 --> 00:02:51,380
to practice these forbidden arts.

33
00:02:52,470 --> 00:02:55,260
I'll destroy everything you've worked for.

34
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:00,060
The blood pool.

35
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:01,730
Du Zhong!

36
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,690
Why is Master Du leaving now?

37
00:03:25,710 --> 00:03:26,410
I'm fine.

38
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:28,260
You took a direct hit from the Five Great Sects.

39
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:29,780
How can you be fine?

40
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:36,100
I think this protected me.

41
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,890
The talisman's been repaired?

42
00:03:39,430 --> 00:03:40,450
Du Zhong has it,

43
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:42,060
it's still missing a piece.

44
00:03:42,680 --> 00:03:43,260
What a shame.

45
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:44,820
Don't worry about that.

46
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,410
Once I reclaim the malice,

47
00:03:48,310 --> 00:03:49,260
I can fix

48
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:50,260
that little flaw too.

49
00:03:50,630 --> 00:03:51,130
Really?

50
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,450
Don't ever do that again.

51
00:04:09,560 --> 00:04:11,130
You could've gathered all the malice

52
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:12,260
and left Mount Zhaowu long ago.

53
00:04:13,310 --> 00:04:14,500
But because of me, you...

54
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:16,250
Even if the immortal sects reject you,

55
00:04:17,310 --> 00:04:18,340
you still won't regret it?

56
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,220
Better than mourning you every day.

57
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,930
I don't want to live with that guilt forever.

58
00:04:30,510 --> 00:04:32,290
I doubt you'd feel guilty forever.

59
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:37,410
Just now, were you worried

60
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:38,980
about the mystical flower

61
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:40,810
or about me?

62
00:04:49,480 --> 00:04:50,900
Back in Qingjing Grove,

63
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,250
we missed a few clues.

64
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,730
What?

65
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,540
Yeniang is Hua Changpu.

66
00:05:00,600 --> 00:05:01,220
That scar,

67
00:05:02,070 --> 00:05:03,140
and the way she walks...

68
00:05:05,510 --> 00:05:06,610
I should've known.

69
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:07,930
Let's get to the blood pool first.

70
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,250
Right now, Hua Changpu

71
00:05:10,310 --> 00:05:11,610
wants nothing but to destroy Du Zhong.

72
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,140
Master.

73
00:06:02,510 --> 00:06:04,250
Can you give up the Path of Detachment?

74
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,580
All these years,

75
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:36,100
why haven't I dreamed of you?

76
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,700
A man devoted to the Path of Detachment,

77
00:07:08,750 --> 00:07:10,100
the leader of Mount Zhaowu,

78
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:14,980
actually gave in to desire

79
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,800
for an ugly old woman

80
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,980
like me.

81
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:23,810
You threw away all your cultivation.

82
00:07:57,480 --> 00:08:00,810
You really have gone mad chasing power.

83
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,850
Your immortal body is broken,

84
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,220
and your cultivation is gone.

85
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,660
Yet you still think

86
00:08:06,160 --> 00:08:08,220
this forbidden blood pool ritual can help you ascend?

87
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,580
There's still the Saintess's divine power.

88
00:08:27,630 --> 00:08:29,730
It's not too late.

89
00:08:31,270 --> 00:08:31,730
Come!

90
00:08:43,790 --> 00:08:44,460
Now,

91
00:08:45,750 --> 00:08:47,580
it's time to honor our agreement.

92
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:48,610
I want you

93
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:50,340
to pour every bit of your divine power

94
00:08:50,630 --> 00:08:52,820
into the life-tracking stone!

95
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:02,580
That's Hua Changpu's life-tracking stone.

96
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:04,820
Why keep the life-tracking stone

97
00:09:04,870 --> 00:09:05,530
of someone who's dead?

98
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,130
She's not dead.

99
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,010
Her life-tracking stone

100
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:14,770
is still glowing.

101
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,340
It's just...

102
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,940
It's been so long.

103
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:24,700
I've never been able to find

104
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:25,490
her remains.

105
00:09:28,550 --> 00:09:29,250
But now...

106
00:09:30,870 --> 00:09:32,490
Now I have this pool of blood and flesh,

107
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:35,130
along with the Saintess's power.

108
00:09:36,030 --> 00:09:37,300
With enough power,

109
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,980
I can create

110
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,980
a new body for her.

111
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:43,850
I will bring her back.

112
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,250
All these years,

113
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,490
day and night,

114
00:09:59,960 --> 00:10:01,940
I've suffered over her tragic death.

115
00:10:04,320 --> 00:10:06,980
It's driven me mad.

116
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:17,580
I don't care about cultivation or power.

117
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,770
I'd give up everything

118
00:10:20,270 --> 00:10:21,490
for just one chance

119
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,370
to make a different choice.

120
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,060
I need Changpu

121
00:10:25,550 --> 00:10:27,490
back by my side!

122
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,460
You wanted her dead,

123
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:38,180
so she died.

124
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:41,130
Now you want her alive,

125
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,340
so she has to come back to life?

126
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:47,940
What gives you the right?

127
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,400
Why should someone

128
00:10:50,400 --> 00:10:51,700
as selfish as you

129
00:10:52,120 --> 00:10:53,130
always get what you want?

130
00:10:56,270 --> 00:10:56,730
Stop!

131
00:11:03,630 --> 00:11:04,130
Duyao.

132
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:10,580
Anyone who stands in my way

133
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:11,980
will die!

134
00:11:14,720 --> 00:11:15,580
Haven't you figured it out?

135
00:11:16,030 --> 00:11:17,180
Yeniang is Hua Changpu.

136
00:11:17,790 --> 00:11:18,490
She's still alive.

137
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:19,980
That's why, after all these years,

138
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:21,250
her life-tracking stone still glows.

139
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,100
Changpu...

140
00:11:43,630 --> 00:11:44,010
You...

141
00:11:53,750 --> 00:11:54,610
Don't remember?

142
00:11:59,910 --> 00:12:01,530
You let Yan Shang

143
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:04,340
break my legs,

144
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,980
ruin my voice,

145
00:12:07,270 --> 00:12:08,460
and scar my face.

146
00:12:09,840 --> 00:12:11,770
Now that I look like this,

147
00:12:13,270 --> 00:12:14,180
you won't even acknowledge me?

148
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,340
That's not true.

149
00:12:16,390 --> 00:12:16,980
It's not.

150
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:19,130
I just didn't know

151
00:12:20,150 --> 00:12:21,250
you were still alive.

152
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,130
Changpu...

153
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,530
Why didn't you come find me?

154
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:28,610
Why didn't you tell me?

155
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:30,420
All your injuries...

156
00:12:31,390 --> 00:12:32,730
I'd have done everything I could

157
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:33,650
to heal them.

158
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,460
And Yan Shang...

159
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:37,530
The day you fell off that cliff,

160
00:12:38,080 --> 00:12:39,460
I killed him

161
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,100
to avenge you.

162
00:12:44,510 --> 00:12:45,130
So...

163
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:47,980
You're even crazier than I am.

164
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:52,460
You think saying all this,

165
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:55,100
giving up your powers and status,

166
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:56,700
and sacrificing everything to save me

167
00:12:58,000 --> 00:12:59,130
will make me forgive you?

168
00:13:02,790 --> 00:13:04,420
All the pain

169
00:13:05,480 --> 00:13:06,460
and suffering I've endured

170
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:10,610
won't disappear just because you're sorry.

171
00:13:19,030 --> 00:13:19,770
Master.

172
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:25,490
I've come back as a ghost

173
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,250
to take my revenge.

174
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:20,650
No!

175
00:14:33,550 --> 00:14:34,100
Master.

176
00:14:36,750 --> 00:14:37,220
Du Zhong!

177
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:39,730
You've been practicing dark arts here?

178
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,100
To fill this entire pool,

179
00:14:42,270 --> 00:14:43,300
how many innocent lives

180
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:45,220
must have been drained of their blood?

181
00:14:51,790 --> 00:14:53,100
There's still time.

182
00:14:54,960 --> 00:14:55,770
Changpu...

183
00:14:56,510 --> 00:14:58,220
Changpu is in this pool.

184
00:14:59,270 --> 00:15:00,130
This time,

185
00:15:00,790 --> 00:15:02,610
I finally have her remains.

186
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:07,250
I just need to kill more people,

187
00:15:08,150 --> 00:15:10,660
- and I can bring her back! - Master!

188
00:15:11,200 --> 00:15:11,700
Master.

189
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:12,600
Let it go.

190
00:15:12,750 --> 00:15:13,700
It's all over.

191
00:15:13,930 --> 00:15:15,250
Hua Changpu is gone.

192
00:15:15,360 --> 00:15:16,530
Please stop this madness.

193
00:15:16,530 --> 00:15:17,610
You shut up!

194
00:15:17,870 --> 00:15:18,850
If he keeps this up,

195
00:15:19,750 --> 00:15:20,650
we'll have no choice but to kill him.

196
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:21,860
No!

197
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:23,200
Let go of me!

198
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:24,420
Let go!

199
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:26,220
Let me go!

200
00:15:27,870 --> 00:15:28,530
Hao.

201
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:31,780
- Let go! - How did Master end up like this?

202
00:15:31,870 --> 00:15:32,760
Let go.

203
00:15:32,790 --> 00:15:33,730
It's over, Master.

204
00:15:34,560 --> 00:15:35,350
Hao.

205
00:15:39,870 --> 00:15:40,850
Let go!

206
00:15:43,780 --> 00:15:45,220
- Master. - Let go!

207
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:48,580
Let me go!

208
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,180
Master.

209
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:54,770
Master.

210
00:15:55,870 --> 00:15:56,610
Let go!

211
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,370
Let me go!

212
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:02,940
Master.

213
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:03,820
No!

214
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:09,580
Master.

215
00:16:10,390 --> 00:16:10,890
Master.

216
00:16:11,750 --> 00:16:12,250
Master.

217
00:16:13,790 --> 00:16:14,340
Master.

218
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:18,730
I've made a small change to the petals.

219
00:16:19,270 --> 00:16:20,180
It's a new dream.

220
00:16:39,670 --> 00:16:40,370
Master.

221
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:43,220
Aside from immortality,

222
00:16:44,910 --> 00:16:45,740
isn't there anything else

223
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:46,700
you want to do?

224
00:17:21,510 --> 00:17:22,090
Changpu.

225
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:25,420
What is it

226
00:17:27,440 --> 00:17:28,530
you want out of this life?

227
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:34,290
I don't care about attaining immortality.

228
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,250
I just want to be

229
00:17:38,310 --> 00:17:38,900
with the one I love,

230
00:17:39,350 --> 00:17:40,220
free from all restraints,

231
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,660
living life on our own terms.

232
00:17:53,510 --> 00:17:54,220
Master.

233
00:17:55,790 --> 00:17:56,660
I love you.

234
00:18:00,590 --> 00:18:01,940
Let's give up the Path of Detachment

235
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:04,420
and just be together.

236
00:18:08,030 --> 00:18:08,700
Can we?

237
00:18:18,440 --> 00:18:19,050
Yes.

238
00:18:19,180 --> 00:18:22,860
♪Before seas turn to fields...♪

239
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:24,250
I should've said yes to you

240
00:18:25,350 --> 00:18:26,140
long ago.

241
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:29,380
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

242
00:18:29,620 --> 00:18:37,140
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

243
00:18:38,260 --> 00:18:41,980
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

244
00:18:42,260 --> 00:18:46,260
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

245
00:18:46,540 --> 00:18:50,140
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

246
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:54,460
♪Still waits to come true♪

247
00:19:10,310 --> 00:19:11,810
Qi Fengyin is absorbing the malice.

248
00:19:12,240 --> 00:19:12,940
At this rate,

249
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,770
the Wanjun Lock won't be able to hold him!

250
00:20:14,240 --> 00:20:16,290
Yamao doesn't like me taking lives.

251
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,810
As for those who hurt her tonight,

252
00:20:21,160 --> 00:20:22,900
I'll spare your lives for now.

253
00:20:23,590 --> 00:20:24,810
But remember this.

254
00:20:26,270 --> 00:20:27,810
The only reason you're still alive

255
00:20:29,030 --> 00:20:30,290
is because of her.

256
00:21:20,000 --> 00:21:20,860
I never thought

257
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:22,790
I'd end up locked

258
00:21:22,790 --> 00:21:23,660
in here myself.

259
00:21:24,440 --> 00:21:26,010
Master often taught us

260
00:21:27,070 --> 00:21:28,490
not to let obsession consume us.

261
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:33,460
But why is it...

262
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:34,770
People like us,

263
00:21:36,550 --> 00:21:37,810
who were never

264
00:21:38,680 --> 00:21:40,220
the rebellious type,

265
00:21:40,830 --> 00:21:43,180
thought we'd found true enlightenment

266
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:48,460
while others were caught up in worldly affairs?

267
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,490
Until someone came along

268
00:21:57,030 --> 00:21:59,050
and little by little,

269
00:22:01,960 --> 00:22:03,330
made us do things for her

270
00:22:03,480 --> 00:22:04,810
we never thought we'd do.

271
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:12,180
Hao.

272
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:14,660
At first,

273
00:22:16,310 --> 00:22:17,250
it was nothing more

274
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:19,700
than a second glance,

275
00:22:24,110 --> 00:22:25,330
an extra word.

276
00:22:27,510 --> 00:22:28,460
I should do the same.

277
00:22:30,070 --> 00:22:31,250
One extra step.

278
00:22:33,110 --> 00:22:33,770
As long as I hold this sword,

279
00:22:35,030 --> 00:22:36,380
no one will lay a hand on her.

280
00:22:38,110 --> 00:22:39,180
Just these

281
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:41,050
ordinary little things.

282
00:22:41,960 --> 00:22:43,290
One part to fool others,

283
00:22:46,000 --> 00:22:48,180
nine parts to fool ourselves.

284
00:22:50,640 --> 00:22:51,900
I'll keep her safe.

285
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:54,180
And I'll keep

286
00:22:55,070 --> 00:22:55,810
the world safe too.

287
00:23:02,550 --> 00:23:03,980
Master treats you like his own son.

288
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:05,180
Are you really going to

289
00:23:05,200 --> 00:23:06,460
defy his orders

290
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:07,490
for a mere herb spirit?

291
00:23:07,790 --> 00:23:08,730
He has repeatedly

292
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:10,660
defied your orders and betrayed the sect.

293
00:23:11,270 --> 00:23:12,570
You can't have it both ways.

294
00:23:13,030 --> 00:23:14,380
You're betraying not only Mount Zhaowu

295
00:23:14,550 --> 00:23:15,860
but also all the other immortal sects!

296
00:23:18,350 --> 00:23:19,660
And before you know it, you've gone too far.

297
00:23:20,480 --> 00:23:22,380
So far that everyone says you're wrong,

298
00:23:23,510 --> 00:23:26,860
and there's no turning back.

299
00:23:31,550 --> 00:23:32,980
All for a fleeting moment of love,

300
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:35,140
you end up losing everything.

301
00:23:41,510 --> 00:23:42,380
Consider this display

302
00:23:42,680 --> 00:23:44,460
of silver blossoms my gift.

303
00:23:45,070 --> 00:23:46,460
May your path to immortality

304
00:23:46,720 --> 00:23:47,860
be as bright as these blossoms

305
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,010
and free of all obstacles.

306
00:23:53,790 --> 00:23:54,770
And I wish you

307
00:23:56,590 --> 00:23:57,420
peace and good fortune.

308
00:24:05,310 --> 00:24:06,050
Hao.

309
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,250
You may go.

310
00:24:26,780 --> 00:24:33,580
♪I seem to meet you again in my dreams♪

311
00:24:33,860 --> 00:24:40,580
♪Perhaps fate had planned it all along♪

312
00:24:40,860 --> 00:24:48,060
♪Moonlight veils your loving eyes♪

313
00:24:48,460 --> 00:24:51,660
♪As if asking why you and I♪

314
00:24:51,740 --> 00:24:57,580
♪Were brought together, only to part♪

315
00:24:57,620 --> 00:25:01,420
♪Dreaming or waking, in sorrow or joy♪

316
00:25:01,460 --> 00:25:04,780
♪All I see is you♪

317
00:25:04,820 --> 00:25:12,340
♪The wind hides every feeling in my heart♪

318
00:25:12,740 --> 00:25:16,220
♪Stars or moon, flowers or snow♪

319
00:25:16,460 --> 00:25:19,620
♪All I see is you♪

320
00:25:19,860 --> 00:25:27,140
♪The wind hides every feeling in my heart♪

321
00:25:27,580 --> 00:25:31,140
♪Stars or moon, flowers or snow♪

322
00:25:31,180 --> 00:25:34,500
♪All I see is you♪

323
00:25:34,540 --> 00:25:40,860
♪No one sees the you I hold in my heart♪

324
00:26:01,200 --> 00:26:01,730
Youyou.

325
00:26:03,590 --> 00:26:04,290
Are you okay?

326
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:07,090
I'm a mighty ancient demon.

327
00:26:07,160 --> 00:26:08,180
These little wounds are nothing.

328
00:26:08,790 --> 00:26:09,410
But you...

329
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:10,550
It's broad daylight.

330
00:26:10,590 --> 00:26:11,900
Shouldn't a nocturnal herb like you

331
00:26:11,920 --> 00:26:12,660
be catching up on sleep?

332
00:26:12,750 --> 00:26:13,530
Why are you up?

333
00:26:13,790 --> 00:26:15,330
The immortal sects still have the talisman.

334
00:26:15,480 --> 00:26:16,570
How could I possibly sleep?

335
00:26:18,720 --> 00:26:20,460
Are you heading to Mount Zhaowu now?

336
00:26:20,920 --> 00:26:22,530
Maybe you should wait for His Lordship

337
00:26:22,590 --> 00:26:24,250
and go once he's condensed the malice.

338
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:26,380
No.

339
00:26:26,830 --> 00:26:27,420
Yuwen Hao

340
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:28,860
would never refuse to return the talisman.

341
00:26:32,830 --> 00:26:33,460
Listen!

342
00:26:35,200 --> 00:26:36,290
If you go now,

343
00:26:36,880 --> 00:26:38,220
he might not even see you.

344
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:40,140
I only just heard the news.

345
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:42,380
Yuwen Hao's master

346
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,380
has died.

347
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:59,940
The inauguration ceremony for the new leader of Mount Zhaowu

348
00:27:00,350 --> 00:27:01,730
shall now begin!

349
00:27:23,070 --> 00:27:24,180
Mount Zhaowu

350
00:27:25,000 --> 00:27:26,290
leads the Five Great Sects.

351
00:27:27,030 --> 00:27:28,380
We cannot go a day without a leader.

352
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:29,570
I understand.

353
00:27:34,550 --> 00:27:36,860
Present the leader's sword.

354
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:50,460
Present the leader's decree.

355
00:27:54,350 --> 00:27:55,900
The ceremony is complete!

356
00:28:14,960 --> 00:28:15,980
I, Yuwen Hao,

357
00:28:16,920 --> 00:28:17,940
following my late master's wishes,

358
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:19,180
hereby assume

359
00:28:19,750 --> 00:28:21,980
the position of Mount Zhaowu's 19th leader.

360
00:28:23,160 --> 00:28:24,570
From this day forward, I devote myself to the immortal path.

361
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:27,180
I'll put the people of this world first.

362
00:28:28,200 --> 00:28:28,770
Free of ego,

363
00:28:29,310 --> 00:28:29,810
free of ambition,

364
00:28:30,790 --> 00:28:31,810
free of desire and attachment.

365
00:28:33,200 --> 00:28:34,140
I'll live in harmony with all things

366
00:28:35,480 --> 00:28:37,010
and be one with the way of Heaven.

367
00:28:40,960 --> 00:28:42,420
We pay our respects, Master Yuwen!

368
00:29:15,350 --> 00:29:16,700
Will you come out on your own,

369
00:29:17,350 --> 00:29:18,190
or do I have to

370
00:29:18,190 --> 00:29:19,290
send someone to drag you out?

371
00:29:31,680 --> 00:29:33,180
I'm here to congratulate Hao

372
00:29:33,590 --> 00:29:34,460
on becoming the new leader.

373
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:35,570
Congratulate him?

374
00:29:37,640 --> 00:29:38,900
I've never seen anyone

375
00:29:39,270 --> 00:29:41,010
so utterly shameless.

376
00:29:43,110 --> 00:29:44,900
Master should've been the one

377
00:29:45,790 --> 00:29:47,050
to preside over today's ceremony.

378
00:29:48,160 --> 00:29:49,730
But he's no longer with us.

379
00:29:50,680 --> 00:29:52,420
Hao didn't even get to see him off

380
00:29:53,480 --> 00:29:55,290
before taking over as leader.

381
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:58,140
And it's all because of you.

382
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:00,460
How dare you show your face here?

383
00:30:03,030 --> 00:30:03,980
If you're done talking,

384
00:30:04,270 --> 00:30:05,570
I'll go find Hao.

385
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:08,490
So you do have a guilty conscience.

386
00:30:09,510 --> 00:30:11,140
Master and Hao

387
00:30:11,480 --> 00:30:12,770
kindly brought you to Mount Zhaowu.

388
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:15,620
Little did they know they'd let a wolf in.

389
00:30:16,200 --> 00:30:17,010
You wicked demon.

390
00:30:17,680 --> 00:30:19,330
You didn't just fake Qi Fengyin's death.

391
00:30:19,830 --> 00:30:21,660
You secretly hid him on Mount Zhaowu.

392
00:30:23,720 --> 00:30:24,660
If I'd known how things would turn out,

393
00:30:25,310 --> 00:30:26,220
I should've

394
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:26,900
killed you,

395
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:28,380
you ungrateful wretch!

396
00:30:29,270 --> 00:30:30,250
Don't cultivators

397
00:30:30,750 --> 00:30:32,050
learn to watch your mouths?

398
00:30:32,640 --> 00:30:34,140
You've been through a lot lately,

399
00:30:34,400 --> 00:30:35,290
so I wasn't going to argue with you.

400
00:30:35,750 --> 00:30:36,720
But you just keep

401
00:30:36,720 --> 00:30:37,530
pushing your luck.

402
00:30:38,030 --> 00:30:39,460
Du Zhong met his end

403
00:30:39,790 --> 00:30:41,290
because his inner demons consumed him.

404
00:30:41,680 --> 00:30:42,860
What's that got to do with me?

405
00:30:43,270 --> 00:30:44,460
And you call me ungrateful?

406
00:30:46,000 --> 00:30:46,980
Remember how my master

407
00:30:47,310 --> 00:30:48,180
helped you

408
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:48,940
defend Mount Qihuang?

409
00:30:50,110 --> 00:30:51,220
But when he became a soul crystal

410
00:30:51,510 --> 00:30:52,940
and fell into Qi Fengyin's hands,

411
00:30:53,440 --> 00:30:54,620
how did you treat him?

412
00:30:59,480 --> 00:30:59,940
Forget it.

413
00:31:01,400 --> 00:31:02,570
Enjoy running your mouth

414
00:31:02,830 --> 00:31:04,050
while you still can.

415
00:31:04,920 --> 00:31:06,250
No matter what you say,

416
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:07,780
it won't change

417
00:31:07,780 --> 00:31:09,810
the fact that your reputation is ruined.

418
00:31:13,590 --> 00:31:14,860
Hao is at Qingjing Grove.

419
00:31:16,240 --> 00:31:17,090
You'd better make this

420
00:31:17,090 --> 00:31:18,330
the last time you bother him.

421
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:21,010
Mount Zhaowu's reputation

422
00:31:21,070 --> 00:31:22,570
has taken a serious blow among the immortal sects.

423
00:31:23,070 --> 00:31:24,530
He has enough on his shoulders.

424
00:31:26,680 --> 00:31:27,490
He can't afford

425
00:31:27,550 --> 00:31:28,530
to be linked to you again!

426
00:31:32,070 --> 00:31:33,140
I just want the talisman back

427
00:31:33,140 --> 00:31:33,770
so I can save my master.

428
00:31:42,900 --> 00:31:47,740
[Here Lies My Master, Du Zhong]

429
00:32:13,160 --> 00:32:14,180
What happened to Mount Zhaowu today

430
00:32:15,960 --> 00:32:16,900
wasn't your fault.

431
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:19,530
Don't blame yourself.

432
00:32:21,550 --> 00:32:22,290
At a time like this,

433
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:24,380
I should be comforting you.

434
00:32:27,510 --> 00:32:28,660
You're here for the talisman?

435
00:32:34,110 --> 00:32:34,660
Yamao.

436
00:32:36,720 --> 00:32:37,700
You once told me

437
00:32:38,400 --> 00:32:39,620
your greatest wish

438
00:32:40,550 --> 00:32:41,940
was to save High Immortal Danshen.

439
00:32:43,880 --> 00:32:44,730
If that's true,

440
00:32:46,030 --> 00:32:47,330
why would you turn all the immortal sects

441
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:48,900
against you for Qi Fengyin?

442
00:32:50,310 --> 00:32:50,900
How can you

443
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:53,770
face High Immortal Danshen after this?

444
00:32:55,510 --> 00:32:56,770
I'll explain everything to Master.

445
00:32:57,160 --> 00:32:57,900
Qi Fengyin

446
00:32:58,310 --> 00:32:59,480
isn't the monster

447
00:32:59,480 --> 00:33:00,330
everyone makes him out to be.

448
00:33:00,990 --> 00:33:01,940
You spent some time with him

449
00:33:01,940 --> 00:33:03,300
in Xiangyuan Village.

450
00:33:03,800 --> 00:33:04,530
You should know

451
00:33:04,530 --> 00:33:05,360
what kind of person he really is.

452
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:08,460
He's the source of all malice in this world.

453
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:10,260
No matter what kind of person

454
00:33:10,260 --> 00:33:11,290
he chooses to become,

455
00:33:11,830 --> 00:33:12,570
this world

456
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:14,220
will never accept him.

457
00:33:21,750 --> 00:33:22,660
You can have the talisman.

458
00:33:23,750 --> 00:33:24,250
But

459
00:33:26,270 --> 00:33:27,770
you must bring that girl in exchange.

460
00:33:28,720 --> 00:33:29,730
That girl?

461
00:33:31,640 --> 00:33:32,530
You mean Duyao?

462
00:33:35,350 --> 00:33:37,180
Duyao may be the spirit of Uncle Du's artifact,

463
00:33:38,590 --> 00:33:40,180
but Uncle Du has passed away.

464
00:33:40,510 --> 00:33:41,450
And she's already decided

465
00:33:41,450 --> 00:33:42,420
to follow Qi Fengyin.

466
00:33:42,830 --> 00:33:43,620
Forcing her to stay

467
00:33:43,620 --> 00:33:44,790
isn't like you.

468
00:33:45,110 --> 00:33:46,530
Besides, Mount Zhaowu is full of men.

469
00:33:46,920 --> 00:33:47,900
It wouldn't be right

470
00:33:47,900 --> 00:33:48,630
to leave her here alone.

471
00:33:48,680 --> 00:33:49,460
Whether it's right or not

472
00:33:51,030 --> 00:33:52,290
is no longer your concern.

473
00:33:56,070 --> 00:33:56,620
Yamao.

474
00:33:58,200 --> 00:33:59,180
If you want to save your master,

475
00:34:00,790 --> 00:34:02,220
you'll have to trade her for the talisman.

476
00:34:10,760 --> 00:34:11,900
Who exactly is she?

477
00:34:31,510 --> 00:34:32,420
At a time like this,

478
00:34:32,710 --> 00:34:33,780
what's there to think about?

479
00:34:34,320 --> 00:34:35,610
Would I really sacrifice

480
00:34:35,670 --> 00:34:36,490
my master

481
00:34:36,840 --> 00:34:38,420
for someone I barely know?

482
00:34:39,480 --> 00:34:40,570
But she doesn't know any better,

483
00:34:41,360 --> 00:34:42,380
and she trusts me completely.

484
00:34:43,110 --> 00:34:43,610
I know full well

485
00:34:43,630 --> 00:34:45,050
she wants to follow Qi Fengyin.

486
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:46,770
Tricking her into going to Mount Zhaowu

487
00:34:47,230 --> 00:34:48,420
would be downright cruel.

488
00:34:49,150 --> 00:34:49,860
So what if it's cruel?

489
00:34:50,550 --> 00:34:51,980
I'm no saint to begin with.

490
00:34:52,630 --> 00:34:54,050
Besides, Yuwen Hao isn't like me.

491
00:34:54,510 --> 00:34:55,460
He's an honorable man.

492
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:57,090
He didn't even kill me

493
00:34:57,110 --> 00:34:57,860
when he wanted my herb core.

494
00:34:58,320 --> 00:34:59,130
Why would he hurt someone

495
00:34:59,150 --> 00:35:00,460
as innocent as Duyao?

496
00:35:08,630 --> 00:35:09,170
Yamao.

497
00:35:12,070 --> 00:35:14,300
Big Brother hasn't finished condensing the malice.

498
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:17,820
I'm not here to see him.

499
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:19,490
Duyao.

500
00:35:20,190 --> 00:35:21,290
Let's go find some magical artifacts

501
00:35:21,290 --> 00:35:22,080
to help Qi Fengyin

502
00:35:22,080 --> 00:35:23,050
condense the malice faster.

503
00:35:23,050 --> 00:35:23,570
What do you say?

504
00:35:24,920 --> 00:35:25,420
Okay.

505
00:35:27,440 --> 00:35:28,360
I'm sorry.

506
00:35:28,920 --> 00:35:29,610
I have to do this for Master.

507
00:35:36,630 --> 00:35:38,370
Are we going to look on Mount Zhaowu?

508
00:35:47,840 --> 00:35:48,940
Why would you do that?

509
00:35:50,400 --> 00:35:51,010
I...

510
00:35:52,030 --> 00:35:52,610
I'm sorry.

511
00:35:53,030 --> 00:35:53,570
I really...

512
00:35:53,590 --> 00:35:54,820
Don't you know how dangerous it is here?

513
00:35:55,550 --> 00:35:56,570
You have no spiritual power right now.

514
00:35:56,710 --> 00:35:57,900
You need to stay behind me.

515
00:36:00,150 --> 00:36:00,650
Don't worry.

516
00:36:01,030 --> 00:36:01,980
I'll protect you.

517
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:04,740
What kind of person am I?

518
00:36:05,320 --> 00:36:06,610
How could I trick someone so gullible?

519
00:36:08,400 --> 00:36:09,170
What did you say?

520
00:36:11,670 --> 00:36:12,460
Nothing.

521
00:36:12,840 --> 00:36:15,170
I said, come here.

522
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,170
Come on, hurry back with me.

523
00:36:17,440 --> 00:36:18,820
But we haven't found

524
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:19,780
an artifact for Big Brother yet.

525
00:36:20,440 --> 00:36:21,130
Forget the artifact.

526
00:36:21,360 --> 00:36:22,530
Bad guys always live forever, you know?

527
00:36:23,150 --> 00:36:23,740
We'd be better off

528
00:36:23,880 --> 00:36:24,740
finding something to help you

529
00:36:24,760 --> 00:36:25,210
think straight.

530
00:36:25,670 --> 00:36:25,940
Come on.

531
00:36:26,630 --> 00:36:27,010
But...

532
00:36:30,440 --> 00:36:32,210
You didn't bring the talisman back?

533
00:36:35,590 --> 00:36:36,090
Get up!

534
00:36:37,070 --> 00:36:37,980
So you just left

535
00:36:37,980 --> 00:36:39,210
the talisman with Yuwen Hao?

536
00:36:39,880 --> 00:36:41,210
That's my precious treasure!

537
00:36:41,320 --> 00:36:42,980
How could you let Mount Zhaowu keep it?

538
00:36:43,070 --> 00:36:43,690
Now I'm angry!

539
00:36:45,070 --> 00:36:46,650
So you really are after the talisman!

540
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:47,780
- I... - Listen to me!

541
00:36:48,070 --> 00:36:49,820
I need that talisman to save my master!

542
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:50,940
Then why didn't you bring it back?

543
00:36:51,000 --> 00:36:51,940
It's all because of Yuwen Hao!

544
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:54,860
He said if I want the talisman,

545
00:36:55,480 --> 00:36:56,460
I have to trade Duyao for it.

546
00:36:58,320 --> 00:36:59,780
Trade Duyao?

547
00:37:01,110 --> 00:37:03,050
That doesn't sound like Yuwen Hao.

548
00:37:03,630 --> 00:37:04,900
Don't you think

549
00:37:04,900 --> 00:37:06,160
everyone on Mount Zhaowu

550
00:37:06,160 --> 00:37:07,070
turns coldhearted

551
00:37:07,070 --> 00:37:08,380
once they become the leader?

552
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:10,490
I just think

553
00:37:11,000 --> 00:37:12,010
there might be something

554
00:37:12,550 --> 00:37:13,300
about Duyao that

555
00:37:13,320 --> 00:37:14,260
we don't know.

556
00:37:15,230 --> 00:37:16,900
Otherwise, Yuwen Hao wouldn't

557
00:37:16,960 --> 00:37:18,130
make such a heartless demand.

558
00:37:26,400 --> 00:37:27,650
I'm sure I heard something just now.

559
00:37:31,230 --> 00:37:31,860
His Lordship.

560
00:37:53,190 --> 00:37:53,780
Qi Fengyin!

561
00:37:53,880 --> 00:37:54,530
My Lord.

562
00:37:55,230 --> 00:37:56,460
What's happening to you?

563
00:37:59,960 --> 00:38:01,610
Aren't you an ancient demon?

564
00:38:01,710 --> 00:38:02,500
Shouldn't you know

565
00:38:02,500 --> 00:38:03,300
better than I do?

566
00:38:03,400 --> 00:38:03,780
He...

567
00:38:04,230 --> 00:38:04,690
I...

568
00:38:12,630 --> 00:38:13,330
Yamao!

569
00:38:13,510 --> 00:38:14,130
Are you okay?

570
00:38:15,150 --> 00:38:15,570
No.

571
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:16,740
I can't get near him.

572
00:38:20,630 --> 00:38:21,340
Yamao?

573
00:38:23,800 --> 00:38:24,690
What's wrong with you?

574
00:38:25,030 --> 00:38:25,860
I kept calling you,

575
00:38:25,880 --> 00:38:26,610
but you didn't respond.

576
00:38:26,920 --> 00:38:27,490
My Lord.

577
00:38:27,880 --> 00:38:29,860
Why did you suddenly lose control?

578
00:38:30,550 --> 00:38:31,780
You're already a mighty devil.

579
00:38:32,230 --> 00:38:33,610
Can you still lose control of your powers?

580
00:38:34,320 --> 00:38:35,170
I don't know.

581
00:38:36,710 --> 00:38:37,940
While condensing the malice,

582
00:38:39,150 --> 00:38:40,860
too many thoughts flooded my mind.

583
00:38:42,070 --> 00:38:43,420
I couldn't focus.

584
00:38:45,440 --> 00:38:46,940
Maybe you're pushing yourself too hard.

585
00:38:47,630 --> 00:38:48,940
Why not take half a day off

586
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:49,860
before you continue?

587
00:38:50,320 --> 00:38:51,820
We're not in a rush anyway.

588
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,820
I was going to steal the talisman tonight.

589
00:38:58,480 --> 00:38:59,610
But I'll have to stay with Qi Fengyin

590
00:38:59,630 --> 00:39:00,380
until he's finished condensing the malice.

591
00:39:03,980 --> 00:39:07,220
[Strive to Cultivate Noble Virtue]

592
00:39:44,960 --> 00:39:45,610
Looking for this?

593
00:39:48,840 --> 00:39:49,690
You came for the talisman.

594
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:51,650
Are you doing this for Yamao

595
00:39:52,150 --> 00:39:53,090
or for Qi Fengyin?

596
00:40:00,800 --> 00:40:01,740
There's no need to be nervous.

597
00:40:02,840 --> 00:40:04,090
I'm not going to stop you.

598
00:40:28,670 --> 00:40:29,940
Why did you pressure Yamao

599
00:40:30,400 --> 00:40:31,650
into trading me for the talisman?

600
00:40:32,280 --> 00:40:33,340
Do you really want to know?

601
00:40:34,480 --> 00:40:36,130
Everything my master kept from you.

602
00:40:37,280 --> 00:40:38,090
Your name,

603
00:40:38,630 --> 00:40:39,300
your identity,

604
00:40:40,230 --> 00:40:41,610
and everything you've ever wanted.

605
00:40:42,630 --> 00:40:43,780
Whenever you're ready to know,

606
00:40:44,190 --> 00:40:45,460
come find me at Mount Zhaowu.

607
00:40:49,190 --> 00:40:50,050
I'll tell you everything.

608
00:41:03,590 --> 00:41:04,170
Master Yuwen.

609
00:41:04,710 --> 00:41:06,050
You're just letting her take the talisman?

610
00:41:06,840 --> 00:41:08,420
She came for it alone.

611
00:41:09,630 --> 00:41:10,290
That means Yamao

612
00:41:10,290 --> 00:41:11,380
has already made her choice.

613
00:41:11,510 --> 00:41:13,040
She won't trade Duyao for it.

614
00:41:14,280 --> 00:41:15,010
If this goes on,

615
00:41:15,510 --> 00:41:17,260
High Immortal Danshen's life will be at risk.

616
00:41:18,630 --> 00:41:19,490
I might as well let her have it.

617
00:41:20,320 --> 00:41:21,050
I don't understand.

618
00:41:22,110 --> 00:41:23,380
Why do you and Master

619
00:41:23,800 --> 00:41:25,050
both want to bring her here?

620
00:41:26,840 --> 00:41:27,780
Do you know who she is?

621
00:41:46,070 --> 00:41:46,940
Duyao's missing!

622
00:41:47,710 --> 00:41:48,650
I told her today

623
00:41:48,920 --> 00:41:50,940
that Mount Zhaowu has magical artifacts

624
00:41:51,000 --> 00:41:52,090
that could help Qi Fengyin condense the malice faster.

625
00:41:53,120 --> 00:41:53,960
She didn't go

626
00:41:53,960 --> 00:41:54,980
to Mount Zhaowu alone, did she?

627
00:41:54,980 --> 00:41:55,780
Oh, Yamao!

628
00:41:56,160 --> 00:41:57,820
She follows you and His Lordship everywhere.

629
00:41:58,070 --> 00:41:58,740
Of course she believes

630
00:41:58,740 --> 00:41:59,570
everything you two say.

631
00:42:00,130 --> 00:42:01,650
You shouldn't have gone soft on her.

632
00:42:01,960 --> 00:42:02,940
Now you have no talisman,

633
00:42:03,070 --> 00:42:03,940
and you've lost her too.

634
00:42:04,030 --> 00:42:05,050
You've ended up with nothing.

635
00:42:06,670 --> 00:42:07,820
Stay here and watch Qi Fengyin.

636
00:42:07,880 --> 00:42:08,740
I'll go to Mount Zhaowu.

637
00:42:10,880 --> 00:42:11,530
Qi Fengyin.

638
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:16,090
Qi Fengyin!

639
00:42:43,400 --> 00:42:45,140
If he keeps causing such a commotion,

640
00:42:45,360 --> 00:42:46,580
the immortal sects will find us.

641
00:42:46,800 --> 00:42:48,090
I know how to calm him down.

642
00:43:12,230 --> 00:43:13,860
My Lord, wake up!

643
00:43:14,030 --> 00:43:15,200
It's Yamao!

644
00:43:15,670 --> 00:43:17,540
She's the woman you love most!

645
00:44:05,000 --> 00:44:06,130
I can take responsibility for you, too.

646
00:44:06,670 --> 00:44:09,090
We can get married and become husband and wife.

647
00:44:09,280 --> 00:44:11,010
Even after the mystical flower hatches,

648
00:44:11,190 --> 00:44:12,410
I won't want to let you go.

649
00:44:12,920 --> 00:44:14,550
But once she touches the shrine,

650
00:44:14,800 --> 00:44:16,050
its memories and powers

651
00:44:16,070 --> 00:44:17,440
will return to her body.

652
00:44:17,550 --> 00:44:19,260
The only reason I awakened

653
00:44:19,440 --> 00:44:21,460
was to kill Qi Fengyin.

654
00:44:41,380 --> 00:44:45,420
♪See this world where flowers have yet to bloom♪

655
00:44:45,660 --> 00:44:49,100
♪So many longings♪

656
00:44:49,780 --> 00:44:51,860
♪Linger in the web of fate♪

657
00:44:52,060 --> 00:44:57,060
♪Then vanish like mist in a moment♪

658
00:44:57,980 --> 00:45:02,020
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

659
00:45:02,260 --> 00:45:05,700
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

660
00:45:06,380 --> 00:45:08,460
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

661
00:45:08,660 --> 00:45:16,060
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

662
00:45:17,460 --> 00:45:21,140
♪When a hundred thousand blossoms have withered♪

663
00:45:21,380 --> 00:45:25,060
♪I'll still want to stay with you like this forever♪

664
00:45:25,700 --> 00:45:29,260
♪The wish we made in the long night♪

665
00:45:29,580 --> 00:45:33,740
♪Still waits to come true♪

666
00:45:33,980 --> 00:45:37,660
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

667
00:45:38,220 --> 00:45:41,860
♪I'll stay by your side♪

668
00:45:42,340 --> 00:45:45,940
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

669
00:45:46,180 --> 00:45:53,500
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪

670
00:46:06,980 --> 00:46:11,020
♪Before seas turn to fields♪

671
00:46:11,260 --> 00:46:14,700
♪Dreams scatter across the sky♪

672
00:46:15,380 --> 00:46:17,460
♪One look into each other's eyes♪

673
00:46:17,620 --> 00:46:25,060
♪And we fall in love in an instant♪

674
00:46:25,980 --> 00:46:29,660
♪However many hardships this vast world holds♪

675
00:46:30,260 --> 00:46:33,860
♪I'll stay by your side♪

676
00:46:34,380 --> 00:46:37,940
♪Love will grace our days till the end of time♪

677
00:46:38,180 --> 00:46:45,500
♪When the dream ends, we'll have no regrets♪
